@startuml
!include _theme.puml
title seq-01: Voter opens the media page and taps a medium (US-20, US-21, US-22)

actor "Voter" as voter
participant "app.ts" as app
participant "media.ts" as media
participant "media-model.ts" as model
participant "js/media-graph.js" as graph

voter -> app : taps Médias in the menu
activate app
app -> app : shows the media block,\nhides the territory bar,\nsets the address
app -> media : render
deactivate app
activate media
media -> model : lists by genre, bridges
model --> media : Éditeur, Propriétaire, Au sommet\nper medium; people in 2 chains or more
media --> voter : lists and the empty card
alt first opening
  media -> graph : adds the script to the page\n(classic script, works from file://)
  graph --> media : ready
end
media -> graph : drawNetwork(data, show)
deactivate media
activate graph
graph --> voter : Réseau in its box\n(pan and zoom inside)
voter -> graph : taps a node
graph -> media : show(id)
deactivate graph
activate media
media -> model : cardLines(id)
model --> media : publisher with legal form and seat,\nholders and shares, disputes,\nfög value or none
media --> voter : card with sources and dates,\n"Tonalité des votations" or\n"Pas de mesure du fög pour ce média",\n"Signaler une erreur"
deactivate media

note over voter, graph
  Soleil follows the same path: drawSun(data, show).
  The lists reach the same card by keyboard.
  Nothing is fetched: the data is in the main script.
end note

@enduml
